---
---
<div class="bg-[#f95602] rounded-[20px] p-6 sm:p-7">
  <h2 class="font-extrabold text-4xl text-[#111111] mb-2">Paquetes</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#111111]/80 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
    Selección, edición y entrega en nube. Perfectos para tu sesión, en la mayor
    parte de Felipe Carrillo Puerto sin costo extra.
  </p>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-5">

    <!-- Básico -->
    <div data-reveal class="plan-card">
      <span class="plan-shadow"></span>
      <h3 class="plan-name">Básico</h3>
      <p class="plan-fotos">40 fotos</p>
      <ul class="plan-list">
        <li>Edición profesional incluida</li>
        <li>Entrega en nube gratis · <strong>USB + $100</strong></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="plan-price">$900<span class="plan-cuota">$22.50 c/u</span></p>
    </div>

    <!-- Platino (destacado) -->
    <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="120" class="plan-card plan-card--featured">
      <span class="plan-shadow"></span>
      <span class="plan-badge">Más popular</span>
      <h3 class="plan-name">Platino</h3>
      <p class="plan-fotos">70 fotos</p>
      <ul class="plan-list">
        <li>Prioridad de entrega en 12 h</li>
        <li>Nube o USB incluido</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="plan-price">$1,500<span class="plan-cuota">$21.50 c/u</span></p>
    </div>

    <!-- Dorado -->
    <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="180" class="plan-card">
      <span class="plan-shadow"></span>
      <h3 class="plan-name">Dorado</h3>
      <p class="plan-fotos">100 fotos</p>
      <ul class="plan-list">
        <li>Gran galería para todo el evento</li>
        <li>Nube o USB incluido</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="plan-price">$2,200<span class="plan-cuota">$22 c/u</span></p>
    </div>

    <!-- Personalizado -->
    <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="240" class="plan-card">
      <span class="plan-shadow"></span>
      <h3 class="plan-name">Personalizado</h3>
      <p class="plan-fotos">+150 fotos</p>
      <ul class="plan-list">
        <li>Diseñado a tu medida</li>
        <li>Nube o USB incluido</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="plan-price">Desde $3,150<span class="plan-cuota">$21 c/u</span></p>
    </div>

  </div>

  <p class="text-[#111111] mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">
    Servicios fuera de Felipe Carrillo Puerto incluyen viáticos cotizados por
    separado — <span class="font-bold">contáctenos</span> o cotízalo en la
    calculadora.
  </p>
</div>

<style is:global>
  .plan-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    background: #111111;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 18px 18px;
    position: relative;
    transition:
      transform 0.5s var(--ease-out-quart),
      box-shadow 0.5s var(--ease-out-quart),
      border-color 0.35s ease;
    will-change: transform, box-shadow;
  }

  .plan-card::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(circle at var(--mx) var(--my),
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 14px 14px;
    background-position: calc(var(--mx) - 7px) calc(var(--my) - 7px);
    filter: url(#grain);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.6s var(--ease-out-expo);
    z-index: 1;
    mask-image: radial-gradient(70px circle at var(--mx) var(--my), black 40%, transparent 100%);
    -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(70px circle at var(--mx) var(--my), black 40%, transparent 100%);
  }

  .plan-shadow {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -16px;
    left: 10%;
    right: 10%;
    height: 35px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(
      ellipse at var(--mx) 50%,
      rgba(249, 86, 2, 0.4),
      transparent 70%
    );
    filter: blur(12px);
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.5s ease;
    z-index: -1;
  }

  .plan-card:hover::before {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .plan-card:hover .plan-shadow {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .plan-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px);
    border-color: rgba(249, 86, 2, 0.4);
    box-shadow: 0 18px 36px -14px rgba(249, 86, 2, 0.35),
      0 0 0 1px rgba(249, 86, 2, 0.15);
  }

  .plan-card > *:not(.plan-shadow) {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 3;
  }

  .plan-card--featured {
    border-color: #f95602;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #171717 0%, #111111 100%);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px #f95602;
  }

  .plan-name {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: #fff;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .plan-fotos {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #f95602;
    margin: 4px 0 10px;
  }

  .plan-list {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: rgba(202, 202, 202, 0.85);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    flex: 1;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .plan-list strong {
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .plan-price {
    margin: 12px 0 2px 0;
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #fff;
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 6px;
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .plan-card:hover .plan-price {
    color: #f95602;
  }

  .plan-cuota {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: rgba(202, 202, 202, 0.6);
  }

  .plan-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: -10px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: #111111;
    color: #f95602;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .plan-card {
      transition: none;
    }
    .plan-card:hover {
      transform: none;
      box-shadow: none;
    }
    .plan-card::before,
    .plan-shadow {
      transition: none;
      opacity: 0;
    }
    .plan-card:hover::before,
    .plan-card:hover .plan-shadow {
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }
</style>